      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALTONA BEACH (1) missed the frame latest but had been racing well prior to that including a Grade 5 win two back (21.75) at Q Lakeside. Can make amends this time. GREAT INTENT (3) is an honest type in the frame at seven of 24 starts including nine wins, the latest scoring (19.05) over 350m at this track. Strike rate this course and distance strong having won five of eight tries. Looks well placed here and has the ability. Go well. LITTLE HOUSE (7) has been out of the placings last two but shapes well for this if she can recapture her handy win a few runs back, getting around Q Lakeside over 352m in 19.68. Expected to feature on best figures. ACES UP HERE (8) profiles nicely here at this trip.",
